{"3827720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HoneyMoon To Hell", "steam_appid": 3827720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HoneyMoon to hell is an adventure game filled with puzzles to play along with your partner.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face puzzle sequences in different scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenges that combine precision and timing mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate roles: each player will always have a different mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill the tour of the location and move on to new destinations of the hell with different mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a different theme, related to destinations where lovers often go and the problems or annoyances that can arise in those types of places.  The characters, aiming to learn new things and have new experiences, will learn new mechanics, characterized by the level they are entering.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HoneyMoon to hell is an adventure game filled with puzzles to play along with your partner.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face puzzle sequences in different scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenges that combine precision and timing mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate roles: each player will always have a different mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill the tour of the location and move on to new destinations of the hell with different mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a different theme, related to destinations where lovers often go and the problems or annoyances that can arise in those types of places.  The characters, aiming to learn new things and have new experiences, will learn new mechanics, characterized